@segment  return-anchor
@title    The Instant Return Anchor
@levels   F10
@duration ~50s

say At any time from this moment forward, if you desire to return to full physical and mental awareness, repeat the number one in your mind.
pause 4
say When you do this, you will return. Fully awake, both physically and mentally. Clear. Alert. Present.
pause 5
say And the more you use this method to return to waking consciousness in physical matter reality, the easier and more natural it will become.
pause 5
say But for now. Mind awake. Body asleep.
pause 8
